## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-spice-glue-id` (GLUE):** The WG decided to move forward with the specification using a string prefix format instead of registering URI/URN schemes.
2. **`draft-ietf-spice-vdcarch` (Architecture):** 
   * "Credential Manager" will remain the primary specification term; "wallet" will be framed as a use case/colloquial term.
   * Henk Birkholz to provide exemplary use-case text for section 2 by December 2024.

